OL,3,GNEWSAFuture of firework night still in
OL,4,Adiscussion
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe future of a town's annual firework
OL,7,Fdisplay is still being discussed, a
OL,8,Fcouncil has said.
OL,10,FIn May, North Northamptonshire Council
OL,11,Fsaid no decision had been made on
OL,12,FCorby's free annual November event,
OL,13,Fafter speculation was raised it might
OL,14,Fbe axed.
OL,16,FThe authority said "positive
OL,17,Fconversations" were being held and it
OL,18,Fwould be "delighted" to see it
OL,19,Fcontinue, but increased financial
OL,20,Fpressures meant difficult decisions
OL,21,Fhave to be made.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
